- Get-WinUserLanguageList
- 
$LangList = Get-WinUserLanguageList
$LangList = $LangList | Where-Object LanguageTag -ne "en-GB"
Set-WinUserLanguageList $LangList -Force

If the UK keyboard still appears

Run:

Get-WinUserLanguageList

If en-GB is gone but ENG UK still appears in the taskbar, sign out and back in (or restart).

If you want to force the PC to have only US English and US keyboard, use:

Set-WinUserLanguageList en-US -Force

Then restart Windows:

Restart-Computer
